            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nēmō exitum reī prōvidēre poterat. Nobody could foresee the outcome of the affair."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine, 4th declension, from exeō, 'to go out'. English exit."
