              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "intervallum, intervallī — \"a gap, an interval\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Post breve intervallum nūntius alter vēnit. After a short interval a second messenger came."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. First the space between two stakes of a rampart, then any gap in space or time."
            }
          ]
        },
