              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mōmentō temporis omnia mūtāta sunt. In a moment of time everything was changed."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. A slight movement that tips the scales, then an instant, and also 'weight, importance'. English moment, momentum."
            }
          ]
        },
